 ## Modeling Notes
 
 - **Account vs member:** `users` is the login account (Laravel Auth); `entity_memberships` is the user's link to the entity with role.
+- **Implemented tables:** `entities` (`id`, `name`, `slug` UK `entities_slug_unique`, timestamps, soft deletes; routes bind by `slug`) and `entity_memberships` (`id`, `entity_id`/`user_id` FKs cascade on delete, `role` default `employee`, timestamps, unique `(entity_id, user_id)` `entity_memberships_entity_user_unique`).
